WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:34.680
XUE PAVILION

01:43.680 --> 01:44.560
It's ready.

01:45.480 --> 01:46.400
Made with what we procured, is it?

01:46.480 --> 01:48.000
It's made with the gold we procured.

01:48.080 --> 01:49.560
I watched him the whole time.

01:50.160 --> 01:51.400
Second Master, four cun, as ordered.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.960
It'll be easy for a child to handle.

01:53.040 --> 01:55.360
However, Young Master is still very young.

01:55.440 --> 01:57.320
Should we give him something this sharp?

01:57.400 --> 01:58.680
Why not?

01:58.760 --> 02:00.760
I was already
slaughtering sheep when I was his age.

02:01.360 --> 02:03.840
The young master of the Huben Army
will lead the army in the future.

02:03.920 --> 02:05.320
He has to prove himself capable.

02:07.920 --> 02:08.919
Don't tell my brother.

02:58.320 --> 02:59.320
-Huai'an!
-Huai'an!

03:00.960 --> 03:02.200
-Huai'an!
-Huai'an!

03:11.640 --> 03:13.200
Regarding this matter,

03:13.760 --> 03:15.160
I can only

03:16.240 --> 03:17.720
rely on you.

03:18.960 --> 03:19.920
All right.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.000
I'll do it on your behalf.

03:22.600 --> 03:23.600
You must hang in there.

03:25.120 --> 03:26.000
Please hang in there.

03:28.000 --> 03:28.840
Huai'an.

03:30.920 --> 03:32.160
Please hang in there!

03:44.880 --> 03:45.720
Huai'an?

03:45.800 --> 03:46.880
-Huai'an.
-Xie Huai'an.

03:46.960 --> 03:48.240
-Huai'an.
-Hang in there.

03:48.320 --> 03:50.320
Where is the physician?

03:50.400 --> 03:52.240
Xiaoqing's gone to notify him.
He'll be here soon.

03:52.320 --> 03:54.240
Why did she go to notify him?

03:54.320 --> 03:55.320
Just bring him here!

03:55.400 --> 03:56.720
Huai'an?

03:56.800 --> 03:57.720
Brother.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.000
Hurry!

04:00.880 --> 04:01.720
Prepare the anti-bleeding decoction.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.240
I'll pull out the sword.

04:14.320 --> 04:15.520
You, help me stop the bleeding.

04:15.600 --> 04:16.640
Okay.

04:19.640 --> 04:20.800
Can you do this?

04:22.440 --> 04:23.440
I cannot.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.720
Go away.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.480
Don't stare at me. If he can't do it,

04:28.560 --> 04:29.800
-I can't do it.
-Useless fools.

04:29.880 --> 04:30.800
I'll do it.

04:30.880 --> 04:32.160
He'll bleed a lot.

04:34.280 --> 04:35.120
I'm not afraid.

04:54.000 --> 04:55.120
Hang in there.

05:11.240 --> 05:13.360
I rushed here upon hearing
that Mr. Xie was attacked.

05:13.880 --> 05:15.200
What's the current situation?

05:16.920 --> 05:18.280
How is Mr. Xie doing?

05:22.040 --> 05:23.040
Guys,

05:23.120 --> 05:24.680
why are you all keeping quiet?

05:26.320 --> 05:27.440
Please tell me something.

05:32.560 --> 05:33.400
This…

05:34.920 --> 05:36.280
You want me to head back?

05:36.800 --> 05:37.640
I…

05:38.960 --> 05:40.720
How am I supposed to report back?

05:43.680 --> 05:45.040
It's all my fault.

05:45.640 --> 05:47.520
This wouldn't have happened

05:48.120 --> 05:50.440
had I not failed
to deliver the letter back then.

05:51.280 --> 05:55.520
I was at the entrance just now.
I didn't dare to enter.

05:56.200 --> 05:57.320
I was afraid that he might…

05:58.840 --> 06:00.440
In his letter, he stated

06:02.080 --> 06:03.600
that he would spend the rest of his life

06:04.880 --> 06:06.400
avenging his family.

06:10.000 --> 06:12.160
He was ready for a life like this.

06:14.400 --> 06:15.800
He won't blame anyone

06:18.400 --> 06:19.880
even if he dies in the process.

06:27.960 --> 06:29.200
Don't be afraid.

06:35.880 --> 06:37.920
Huai'an won't fall yet.

07:01.640 --> 07:02.560
Young Master!

07:02.640 --> 07:03.640
The Young Master is here.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.480
Young Master.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.560
Uncle!

07:09.160 --> 07:11.760
Uncle! Father is still alive!

07:11.840 --> 07:13.200
Hurry and find a physician!

07:29.280 --> 07:31.040
Father. Please don't die.

07:31.640 --> 07:32.600
Father!

07:33.440 --> 07:34.680
Don't leave me!

07:35.200 --> 07:36.120
Don't leave me!

07:37.040 --> 07:38.080
Don't leave me!

07:44.280 --> 07:45.360
Father?

07:50.200 --> 07:51.640
Where are we?

07:52.240 --> 07:53.400
It was Uncle!

07:54.200 --> 07:55.680
Uncle rescued us!

08:03.200 --> 08:04.760
Protect your sister.

08:05.880 --> 08:07.400
You two

08:10.880 --> 08:13.720
must live on.

08:21.800 --> 08:23.120
Father!

08:31.680 --> 08:33.440
Father!

08:40.120 --> 08:41.600
Protect your sister.

08:42.679 --> 08:45.520
You two must live on.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.640
Father…

09:03.160 --> 09:04.000
Master.

09:07.360 --> 09:09.360
I know what you guys are trying to ask.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.280
You see…

09:13.200 --> 09:14.360
I don't know.

09:17.440 --> 09:19.000
What do you mean?

09:19.600 --> 09:22.840
He won't die if he manages
to regain consciousness.

09:23.360 --> 09:24.720
That sounds ominous.

09:26.160 --> 09:27.720
What if he doesn't?

09:27.800 --> 09:29.600
Great question.

09:30.600 --> 09:32.360
His injuries are too grievous.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.280
He has lost too much blood.

09:34.360 --> 09:36.360
He might not wake up again.

09:36.880 --> 09:39.040
I already fed him
the medicine I prescribed.

09:39.120 --> 09:40.560
At least his heart can keep beating.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.280
If he doesn't regain consciousness,

09:43.800 --> 09:45.800
he will age very slowly.

09:45.880 --> 09:50.280
By the time we die,
grow old or turn to ashes,

09:51.040 --> 09:53.080
his hair might only just have turned gray.

09:53.160 --> 09:57.960
Does that mean
he'll be in an eternal coma?

09:59.360 --> 10:00.680
You could say so.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.320
He will regain consciousness.

10:04.760 --> 10:06.440
He begged me for a favor
before he fainted.

10:07.160 --> 10:08.080
I know.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.960
There are many things
he has yet to accomplish.

10:11.920 --> 10:14.840
A person like him,
if he has any unfulfilled wishes,

10:17.360 --> 10:18.920
he will surely wake and fulfill them.

10:19.640 --> 10:20.640
Xiaoqing,

10:21.880 --> 10:24.320
the messenger under you is being targeted.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.920
You are being targeted as well.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.920
Let's investigate the case together.

10:40.920 --> 10:42.720
I've worn this charm

10:43.480 --> 10:45.360
as long as I can remember.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.480
Although I've faced many trials,

10:48.960 --> 10:50.960
it did keep me safe until now.

10:59.160 --> 11:00.480
I'll hand it to you.

11:02.760 --> 11:04.400
May you overcome this ordeal.

12:01.280 --> 12:02.480
What does this mean?

12:03.880 --> 12:05.880
The general sent us a letter.

12:06.760 --> 12:09.280
He said you made a mistake.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.960
I want to know

12:15.560 --> 12:17.600
what Yan Fengshan deemed my mistake to be.

12:21.280 --> 12:24.760
When the city fell, your subordinates,

12:26.240 --> 12:28.680
they failed to capture
the deposed emperor.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.560
That was one of your mistakes.

12:32.240 --> 12:35.400
Now that your nephew
has the deposed emperor with him,

12:36.320 --> 12:39.040
there's no way he can be killed off.

12:42.120 --> 12:45.360
You disobeyed the general's order.

12:45.960 --> 12:48.560
Not only did you intervene personally,

12:48.640 --> 12:51.640
but you also mobilized
many of our men without permission.

12:52.680 --> 12:55.240
You completely lost sight
of the bigger picture.

12:56.080 --> 12:58.440
And, Qingyi died because of you.

12:58.960 --> 13:01.000
That was your second mistake.

13:02.320 --> 13:05.440
There's no place for you
in Hidden Soldier Alley anymore.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.360
After him!

14:55.200 --> 14:56.080
Give it to me.

14:56.160 --> 14:57.680
-Just let him play with it.
-Give it to me!

14:57.760 --> 14:58.880
Give it to him.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.440
Give it to me!

15:03.320 --> 15:04.560
Here you go.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.640
Sir, you're seriously wounded.

16:17.160 --> 16:18.360
I didn't dare hire a physician.

16:18.880 --> 16:20.880
I only used the Liu family's
anti-bleeding mix on you.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.360
I was fortunate.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.000
I'm still alive.

16:34.760 --> 16:35.600
Xingzi,

16:35.680 --> 16:37.320
since when did you get yourself a family?

16:40.440 --> 16:42.640
I'm a single man in my thirties.

16:43.160 --> 16:46.480
I was not careful with my coin
when I had some.

16:47.160 --> 16:48.480
Speaking of which,

16:49.440 --> 16:52.680
Sir, you have rarely visited me
all these years.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.880
I never thought I'd see you wounded.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.560
So,

16:57.320 --> 16:58.600
is there anything I can do for you?

17:03.880 --> 17:05.200
Where's your carriage?

17:05.280 --> 17:06.119
I have one.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.319
I keep it
at the marketplace's carriage house.

17:09.520 --> 17:10.400
Can I leave the city in it?

17:10.480 --> 17:12.079
You can. It's fully licensed.

17:12.160 --> 17:13.280
Take me out of the city.

17:15.839 --> 17:17.000
Sir,

17:17.720 --> 17:19.400
I saw that you had a travel pass with you

17:19.480 --> 17:21.599
when I was dressing your wound.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.920
Must I go with you?

17:31.760 --> 17:33.160
Right now,

17:34.880 --> 17:36.880
you're the only person I can trust.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.640
Back then, you joined hands with me
to strike down my brother.

17:49.720 --> 17:50.880
Back then, I…

17:52.280 --> 17:53.520
I merely struck him down

17:54.440 --> 17:57.720
as proof of my loyalty, Sir.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.120
I did it so that I could survive.

18:00.840 --> 18:02.360
Poor people like us

18:02.960 --> 18:05.160
do everything we can to survive.

18:06.760 --> 18:08.600
If you wish to survive,

18:08.680 --> 18:10.880
you have to follow my command.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.000
It is not as though I will harm you.

18:13.520 --> 18:14.600
Am I right?

18:17.320 --> 18:18.520
I'll go and get the carriage.

18:19.120 --> 18:20.720
-It'll take two or three days.
-You have two.

18:20.800 --> 18:23.680
In two days, at sunset,

18:25.040 --> 18:27.320
in the alley west of Yanping Gate,

18:29.400 --> 18:30.800
I'll wait for you there.

18:35.040 --> 18:36.120
Okay.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.320
Xingzi.

19:02.280 --> 19:03.720
Once you've done me this favor,

19:04.920 --> 19:06.520
we shall be even.

19:08.080 --> 19:09.280
We won't see each other again

19:11.520 --> 19:12.800
after I leave the city.

19:15.120 --> 19:16.240
Thank you, sir.

19:38.680 --> 19:41.080
You're chopping firewood at night.
Don't you think it's noisy?

19:44.760 --> 19:46.160
What's wrong?

19:46.680 --> 19:49.120
I was just trying to help her out.

19:49.640 --> 19:52.600
Besides, it's not as if we're
in a stranger's house.

19:52.680 --> 19:54.920
This is Miss Bai Wan's residence.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.440
I'm chopping firewood for her.

19:56.520 --> 19:58.560
What has that to do
with Miss Bai Wan herself?

19:58.640 --> 20:01.960
You were being noisy
by chopping firewood at night.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.920
What I meant was,

20:06.160 --> 20:08.200
Miss Bai Wan was far calmer than we were

20:08.280 --> 20:10.320
when the physician was
pulling the sword from Xie Huai'an.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.040
Now, he needs people to tend to him.

20:12.120 --> 20:14.000
And Miss Bai Wan is
more meticulous than we are.

20:14.080 --> 20:16.920
So I thought
I'd at least chop firewood to help them.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.640
Unlike you, who only stand here
like a statue.

20:43.680 --> 20:45.120
Say,

20:46.040 --> 20:48.200
what's the relationship
between Bai Wan and Xie Huai'an?

20:48.280 --> 20:49.560
That has nothing to do with you.

20:51.320 --> 20:52.200
You should rest early.

20:52.280 --> 20:53.720
You have to take over my shift tomorrow.

20:54.960 --> 20:56.960
Of course it has nothing to do with me.

20:59.040 --> 21:00.760
I know I've fallen from grace.

21:00.840 --> 21:03.240
But back then,
I was a member of the imperial family.

21:03.320 --> 21:06.200
Within the Capital,
among the high-ranking noble families,

21:06.280 --> 21:08.680
I know every matter
related to them, big or small.

21:08.760 --> 21:10.800
I even witnessed some of them.

21:11.320 --> 21:12.400
For example,

21:13.440 --> 21:14.920
Xie Huai'an has a younger sister.

21:20.520 --> 21:22.520
When his sister turned a year old,

21:22.600 --> 21:24.280
she received a birthday gift

21:24.360 --> 21:26.160
that was very eye-catching.

21:26.800 --> 21:30.280
It was a Hard Bamboo Carved Amulet.

21:34.600 --> 21:36.680
And, I saw it last night.

21:36.760 --> 21:37.680
Hey, lower your voice.

21:37.760 --> 21:38.720
What are you saying?

21:39.320 --> 21:41.560
The siblings have been reunited.
Isn't that great?

21:41.640 --> 21:43.000
What are you doing? It's spilling!

21:44.240 --> 21:45.080
That was hot!

21:45.600 --> 21:47.880
Listen.
You'd better keep this to yourself.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.880
If you tell anyone about it,

21:49.960 --> 21:51.400
I'll break your legs.

21:58.200 --> 22:01.120
Huai'an doesn't want her to know
that she's a member of the Liu family.

22:01.200 --> 22:03.200
He said every member
of the Liu family was ill-fated.

22:08.160 --> 22:09.440
Indeed.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.000
And, they don't live long either.

22:13.440 --> 22:15.520
If he doesn't make it this time…

22:16.360 --> 22:17.760
If he passes…

22:20.560 --> 22:21.480
I'll have to flee again.

22:24.200 --> 22:25.280
Don't worry.

22:26.040 --> 22:28.040
If anything happens to Huai'an,

22:28.560 --> 22:29.880
I'll drag you down with him.

22:34.240 --> 22:36.080
What has this got to do with me?

22:36.160 --> 22:37.400
It's because you're a jinx.

22:38.240 --> 22:40.360
He'll be fine.

22:40.440 --> 22:42.840
Grand Preceptor already said
that he could live until the age of 83.

22:42.920 --> 22:45.320
Grand Preceptor? Which one?

22:45.400 --> 22:48.200
The one who was in power when
my father was the emperor, Cen Weizong.

22:48.280 --> 22:50.800
Cen Weizong?
He's a renowned fortune-teller.

22:50.880 --> 22:52.840
That's why I said
his prediction will be accurate.

22:52.920 --> 22:54.600
When did he have his fortune told?

22:55.760 --> 22:56.960
It was when…

22:57.040 --> 22:58.480
Ten…

22:58.560 --> 22:59.680
I think when he was 12.

22:59.760 --> 23:02.360
Huai'an was on the run when he was 12.

23:02.440 --> 23:03.520
He wouldn't have had time
for a fortune reading.

23:03.600 --> 23:06.320
Grand Preceptor told my fortune
when I was 12.

23:07.520 --> 23:09.880
He said I could live until the age of 83.

23:09.960 --> 23:12.920
How could I live until 83
without Xie Huai'an's protection?

23:13.000 --> 23:14.600
If I do live until 83,

23:14.680 --> 23:16.960
doesn't that mean he'll be protecting me
until he's 83?

23:17.040 --> 23:19.520
That's why
Xie Huai'an can live until 83 as well.

23:21.800 --> 23:23.080
Don't worry about it.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.160
Here.

23:35.800 --> 23:36.680
So bitter.

23:41.800 --> 23:43.040
I'll accomplish

23:44.200 --> 23:46.080
the task you assigned once it's dawn.

23:46.920 --> 23:48.400
But I have limited capabilities.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.800
Your revenge must be taken step by step.

23:54.200 --> 23:55.520
If you want full revenge,

23:58.320 --> 23:59.680
you have to wake up

24:01.760 --> 24:02.920
and do it yourself.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.400
What are you staring at?

24:24.480 --> 24:25.840
There's only one bowl here.

24:28.000 --> 24:30.960
I cannot believe she keeps
only one bowl and one teacup in her house.

24:40.120 --> 24:41.160
Is he okay?

24:41.800 --> 24:43.440
He's fine. He's still unconscious.

24:43.520 --> 24:45.480
I have something to do outside.

24:45.560 --> 24:46.880
You're leaving at this moment?

24:48.600 --> 24:49.960
Xiaoqing told me what happened.

24:50.040 --> 24:52.920
Huben attacked you guys out of the blue.
And, there was a huge commotion.

24:53.520 --> 24:56.040
I'm sure security in the city
will be tightened.

24:56.120 --> 24:58.040
They will not dare strike again.

24:58.640 --> 24:59.640
If you're still worried,

24:59.720 --> 25:01.360
tell Commander Wang
to post men here in secret.

25:01.440 --> 25:02.280
It'll be fine.

25:03.280 --> 25:04.200
Okay.

25:04.280 --> 25:05.280
Please go ahead.

25:05.360 --> 25:06.520
I'll keep an eye on him.

25:07.040 --> 25:08.080
You can have the noodles.

25:22.120 --> 25:23.360
Why don't you have them?

25:27.720 --> 25:28.560
Really?

25:44.480 --> 25:45.680
It smells great.

25:46.880 --> 25:48.840
In the future, you can be my book-boy.

25:49.400 --> 25:50.440
Or my cook, perhaps.

26:02.160 --> 26:03.560
Miss, come and take a look.

26:05.160 --> 26:06.240
Look at all the varieties.

26:06.320 --> 26:07.840
-Let's take a look.
-Please take a look.

26:07.920 --> 26:09.640
-Fine goods for sale.
-What do you think?

26:09.720 --> 26:11.000
-How much?
-This one?

26:11.080 --> 26:12.720
It suits you. You can have it for one wen.

26:12.800 --> 26:14.360
-It's raining!
-Let's go! Let's go!

26:14.440 --> 26:16.120
The rain came out of nowhere.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.800
-Let's hurry.
-It's raining. Let's hurry!

26:18.920 --> 26:21.280
‎-Quick, get out of the way.
‎-Hurry up.

26:21.360 --> 26:23.520
Let's seek shelter under the roof.

26:23.600 --> 26:25.600
‎-It's starting to rain.
‎-Come on, move.

26:25.680 --> 26:27.880
Please come again tomorrow.

26:27.960 --> 26:30.040
-Come back tomorrow, sir.
-Let's go, let's go.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.640
These ornaments are exquisite.

26:33.720 --> 26:35.560
I wish to buy some after the rain stops.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.920
Sure. Thank you.

26:39.520 --> 26:40.720
‎Get under cover for a bit.

26:45.640 --> 26:46.920
You’re drenched.

26:49.120 --> 26:51.120
‎-You all right?
‎-Same here.

26:51.200 --> 26:52.760
Miss, you've truly done me a huge favor.

26:53.360 --> 26:55.560
These accessories aren't made
with gold or jade.

26:55.640 --> 26:58.000
I wouldn't be able to sell them out
if they were drenched.

26:58.080 --> 26:59.600
Don't mention it.

26:59.680 --> 27:01.720
From your accent,
I'd say you're not from Chang'an.

27:03.040 --> 27:04.480
I'm not that lucky.

27:04.560 --> 27:06.640
Both my husband and I came from Huzhou.

27:06.720 --> 27:08.960
We run a small trade
to make a living in Chang'an.

27:09.040 --> 27:12.480
In Chang'an, food is costly.
Rent is worse.

27:12.560 --> 27:13.480
It's tough to live here.

27:14.280 --> 27:17.240
Since that's the case,
why didn't you return to Huzhou?

27:17.320 --> 27:19.840
I've tried to persuade my husband
for many years.

27:20.400 --> 27:22.320
But he always told me

27:22.400 --> 27:23.640
that we should give it more time.

27:23.720 --> 27:24.920
He kept saying that.

27:25.000 --> 27:27.880
And now,
our daughter is already 6 years old.

27:27.960 --> 27:29.200
Even so, he still won't leave.

27:30.240 --> 27:31.880
I wonder why.

27:35.280 --> 27:36.520
Miss, what about you?

27:37.880 --> 27:39.080
You owe a blood debt.

27:42.560 --> 27:44.440
That is why you cannot leave.

27:47.880 --> 27:49.640
Miss, what do you mean?

27:55.480 --> 27:56.680
My daughter's bangle.

27:57.280 --> 27:58.680
Why do you have it with you?

27:59.600 --> 28:00.720
Tell your husband this.

28:01.400 --> 28:04.480
It's time for him to clear the debt
he owed 15 years ago.

28:05.080 --> 28:06.520
Your daughter will return to you

28:07.440 --> 28:10.160
once he does so.

28:19.520 --> 28:20.920
It doesn't seem like

28:22.440 --> 28:23.840
the rain will stop anytime soon.

29:05.480 --> 29:06.720
Father.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.720
Are you cold?

29:20.920 --> 29:21.920
Yes.

29:23.480 --> 29:24.880
If this keeps up,

29:25.520 --> 29:27.040
you won't be able to survive.

29:28.200 --> 29:30.080
But Father, I lost you.

29:31.280 --> 29:32.440
At first,

29:33.120 --> 29:34.360
I could've saved you.

29:35.680 --> 29:37.680
I don't want to live anymore.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.720
Whenever you face this moment,

29:42.640 --> 29:44.440
you have to find a reason to live.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.640
I took my sister

29:59.480 --> 30:01.680
out of the Grand Preceptor's Residence.

30:02.840 --> 30:04.520
We left Chang'an.

30:05.040 --> 30:06.880
We walked 70 li.

30:07.600 --> 30:09.360
And, we arrived at Nanwei Trough.

30:09.960 --> 30:11.640
It was too cold.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.280
We were starving.

30:13.960 --> 30:15.920
I couldn't walk anymore.

30:16.920 --> 30:20.080
In the town,
there wasn't a single oil lamp.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.400
There was no fire at all.

30:23.600 --> 30:25.320
But my sister and I…

30:27.920 --> 30:30.200
we wanted to have some hot soup.

30:30.280 --> 30:31.640
I hid her

30:32.160 --> 30:35.080
in a thatched hut by the roadside.

30:35.160 --> 30:36.720
And, I left.

30:37.320 --> 30:40.640
When I found some food
and returned to the hut,

30:40.720 --> 30:42.200
my sister

30:43.440 --> 30:47.000
had already been taken in
by a kind-hearted soul.

31:03.880 --> 31:05.480
She was so young.

31:06.160 --> 31:07.280
She wouldn't have survived

31:08.160 --> 31:09.920
had she stayed with me.

31:11.040 --> 31:12.920
Perhaps she would be able
to grow up safely

31:14.600 --> 31:16.960
if she weren't a member of the Liu family.

31:18.080 --> 31:19.040
After that,

31:19.720 --> 31:21.840
I hid among the reeds of Nanwei Trough

31:22.440 --> 31:24.160
and sustained myself for seven years

31:25.120 --> 31:27.280
as I watched over her.

31:28.720 --> 31:29.920
Her foster family

31:31.880 --> 31:33.160
treated her kindly.

31:36.440 --> 31:38.280
You've already done a great job.

31:40.240 --> 31:41.520
Can you still go on?

31:54.360 --> 31:56.040
I… I'm so worn out.

31:59.440 --> 32:02.560
Why don't you hang on for a little longer?

32:03.640 --> 32:05.720
Until the next blooming season?

32:07.960 --> 32:09.240
I just think

32:09.960 --> 32:11.000
that my son

32:12.600 --> 32:14.600
deserves to see the flowers bloom again.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.640
After the blooming season,

32:18.640 --> 32:20.400
you can wait just a little longer.

32:25.200 --> 32:28.040
Once the petals fall
and the July rains pass,

32:28.720 --> 32:30.720
you can wait just a little longer.

32:31.680 --> 32:34.120
You can wait until your wife
sets a meal before you.

32:34.640 --> 32:35.680
Just lead a peaceful life

32:37.120 --> 32:39.240
as you keep on waiting.

32:43.280 --> 32:44.480
On the surface,

32:45.440 --> 32:46.720
it seems a good life.

32:47.800 --> 32:49.840
It is a life of merely getting by.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.760
Father, your hands are so cold.

33:18.080 --> 33:19.760
You were hunted down.

33:22.080 --> 33:23.440
No matter how I tried to catch up,

33:24.880 --> 33:26.800
I could never catch up to that carriage.

33:27.560 --> 33:30.000
-Father!
-I could only stare.

33:30.720 --> 33:33.120
You were stabbed many times.

33:34.280 --> 33:36.120
-There was blood everywhere.
-Father!

33:37.640 --> 33:40.600
That was my last image of you.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.680
As a son,

33:45.320 --> 33:46.800
from now on,

33:49.200 --> 33:51.000
I merely live

33:52.800 --> 33:54.560
to avenge you.

33:59.160 --> 34:00.520
I don't want you living like this.

34:00.600 --> 34:01.960
But I want to.

34:03.760 --> 34:05.760
Even if I have to sacrifice everything,

34:07.440 --> 34:09.360
I won't hesitate at all.

34:35.920 --> 34:37.040
Revenge…

34:37.760 --> 34:40.679
-Revenge…
-What am I to do if you never wake?

34:43.480 --> 34:45.000
Don't tell me you're already…

34:45.080 --> 34:47.080
Keep talking like that
and you'd better leave.

34:55.080 --> 34:56.120
Revenge…

34:59.680 --> 35:00.840
I think he talked just now.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.400
Come here.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.240
What did he say?

35:05.320 --> 35:07.440
I think he's trying to say

35:08.520 --> 35:10.800
that he wants to find

35:11.920 --> 35:12.960
his mother.

35:17.520 --> 35:18.760
Water.

35:20.760 --> 35:21.800
Water?

35:21.880 --> 35:24.400
-He wants water. Hurry.
-I'll go and get some.

35:28.240 --> 35:29.720
How is he? Has he regained consciousness?

35:29.800 --> 35:31.520
-He talked just now.
-Yeah.

35:31.600 --> 35:33.400
He said he wanted to find his mother.

35:33.480 --> 35:34.880
He also said he wanted some water.

35:37.240 --> 35:40.440
I want to seek revenge.

35:41.280 --> 35:42.560
He's saying

35:44.160 --> 35:45.000
that he wants revenge.

35:54.160 --> 35:55.000
Huai'an?

35:55.520 --> 35:57.080
-Huai'an, you're awake.
-Huai'an?

35:57.160 --> 35:58.360
Finally, my bodyguard is awake.

36:16.640 --> 36:18.200
How long was I out?

36:19.200 --> 36:20.040
Two days.

36:24.720 --> 36:25.680
Be careful.

36:41.600 --> 36:43.120
Regarding the task I told you…

36:43.200 --> 36:46.240
Don't worry about it.
Everything has been arranged.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.240
He hasn't left the city.

36:50.000 --> 36:50.840
Good.

36:54.960 --> 36:56.760
He hasn't left the city, huh?

37:00.960 --> 37:03.000
That means I still stand a chance
to hunt him down.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.240
Hunt him down?

37:07.920 --> 37:09.160
Hunt who?

37:10.200 --> 37:11.400
Liu Ziyan.

37:13.440 --> 37:15.320
He does not deserve to draw breath.

37:36.760 --> 37:37.680
Sir.

38:42.680 --> 38:45.120
All three divinations forebode misfortune.

38:59.840 --> 39:01.320
You're leaving the city at this hour?

39:01.400 --> 39:02.800
I'm on an errand
for the Peacekeeper Corps.

39:02.880 --> 39:04.120
Sir, I have no choice either.

39:04.200 --> 39:06.120
This is the official letter
and travel pass.

39:07.160 --> 39:08.040
You may pass.

39:08.560 --> 39:09.400
Thank you, sir.

39:22.200 --> 39:23.400
Hurry!

39:25.280 --> 39:27.720
I've been getting by
in Chang'an for many years.

39:30.320 --> 39:32.680
In the end, I still
have to leave this city.

40:07.120 --> 40:08.080
What is it?

40:09.080 --> 40:10.280
The carriage hit a rock.

40:16.200 --> 40:17.200
It's dark out.

40:17.840 --> 40:18.680
Be careful.

40:58.400 --> 40:59.960
If I die now,

41:00.840 --> 41:02.960
you'll never learn

41:03.040 --> 41:04.680
what your father

41:05.800 --> 41:07.080
told me

41:07.680 --> 41:09.760
before he died.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.080
It doesn't matter.

41:14.560 --> 41:16.840
That no longer matters to me.

42:04.080 --> 42:04.960
Young Master!

42:05.840 --> 42:07.880
I had no choice either back then.

42:07.960 --> 42:10.760
If I didn't help him out,
I would've been dead!

42:11.800 --> 42:13.320
If I didn't stab your father,

42:13.400 --> 42:16.000
my parents would've been killed!

42:17.120 --> 42:19.680
I was selfish. I was a coward.

42:20.400 --> 42:23.160
I deserve to die!

42:27.320 --> 42:28.760
But you see,

42:28.840 --> 42:30.640
my daughter is innocent in all this.

42:30.720 --> 42:33.040
You can do whatever you want to me.

42:34.000 --> 42:36.680
But please spare my daughter!

42:41.640 --> 42:45.400
FAIR DEALS FOR ALL

42:45.480 --> 42:49.080
NEW FORTUNE, LONG LIFE

42:50.000 --> 42:51.360
You've settled your debt.

42:54.240 --> 42:55.640
You may reunite with your family.

43:06.680 --> 43:08.160
Young Master, thank you!

43:09.760 --> 43:11.800
Young Master, thank you
for your great kindness!

43:13.400 --> 43:15.840
Thank you so much!

43:22.720 --> 43:23.600
My dear girl.

43:24.160 --> 43:25.800
Hurry. Greet your father.

43:25.880 --> 43:27.440
-Father.
-Let me carry you.

43:28.680 --> 43:30.760
Father, you're drenched.

43:30.840 --> 43:32.040
I'm fine.

43:32.120 --> 43:33.040
I'm fine.

43:34.800 --> 43:36.200
Let me dry you.

43:41.640 --> 43:43.120
I thought you would kill him.

43:47.520 --> 43:49.240
I'm different from those people.

43:50.920 --> 43:51.760
Let's go.

43:52.360 --> 43:53.400
Let's head home.

43:53.920 --> 43:56.120
Okay. Let's head home.

43:56.760 --> 43:57.720
Let's head home.

44:26.040 --> 44:28.520
DAHUANG

45:47.680 --> 45:49.600
LIU ZIWEN

45:52.080 --> 45:55.240
LIU ZIWEN

45:57.800 --> 46:03.800
LIU ZIWEN

46:09.640 --> 46:13.440
On the 7th day of the 12th month,
in the 17th year of Qiansheng,

46:13.960 --> 46:16.640
we encountered the body
of General Liu Ziwen along the road.

46:16.720 --> 46:18.720
Our hearts were heavy with grief.

46:19.240 --> 46:21.960
We, mere commoners,

46:22.040 --> 46:25.240
respecting the name
and virtue of the General,

46:25.320 --> 46:29.240
pooled our efforts
to give him a proper burial here.

46:29.320 --> 46:31.320
We performed the rites
on behalf of future generations,

46:31.400 --> 46:32.840
placed him in his coffin,

46:32.920 --> 46:34.560
and interred him in his tomb,

46:34.640 --> 46:37.360
so as to comfort
the heroic spirit of the General.

47:07.600 --> 47:08.560
Father.

47:11.480 --> 47:13.120
So, you were here all along.

47:14.440 --> 47:15.600
The city of Chang'an

47:17.240 --> 47:19.040
has never forgotten about you.

47:26.560 --> 47:27.800
Father.

47:28.320 --> 47:30.520
I'm still alive.

47:30.600 --> 47:32.360
My sister is alive as well.
